{
  "inputs": [
    {
      "id": "372",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "You have done extremely well, <class>.  With ruthless fighters like you conquering in the name of The Forsaken our race is one step closer to defeating Arthas once and for all.  I have a good feeling about you, comrade.",
      "englishSHA256": "a5e0606f925ee1bd48e2e536e35f4a05039c7dc5e3166456cea2d81d3f0c209f"
    },
    {
      "id": "374",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Varimathras would be proud.  You serve your leaders well, <class>.",
      "englishSHA256": "8300a4e0fc7b7d52682e67b5927af1fc9570d7633467925e0a190faee1eee8a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "375",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "I appreciate your efforts, <name>.  May Sylvanas recognize your bravery one day. . . .",
      "englishSHA256": "0690b7fa6b780abd07ac9cf735d776c2077dee3b4cc61536794234934ffba514"
    },
    {
      "id": "398",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Maggot Eye's dastardly acts have finally been avenged.  Maybe your acts of valor will send a clear message to those who wish to bring harm to our people.  On behalf of the town of Brill I thank you, <name>.",
      "englishSHA256": "7e7d0dfa11ddf21c36e47daeed47fc8b2dd4eb32831be51a38ab94acc922ec9d"
    },
    {
      "id": "404",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Have you completed the task with which I have charged you?  Do you have those putrid claws?",
      "englishSHA256": "ca76728219a93467d587a3e8253f537eb4940889a02a6ba5643564040cbe5461"
    },
    {
      "id": "404",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Well done.  I regret not being there to see you smash those <race> into rotting pulp!",
      "englishSHA256": "ecac969b7573c8769e11e34f37c491988c45550b8a25ab49919ac04062ec8200"
    },
    {
      "id": "405",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Greetings.  Either you do not know who I am, or your business with me is urgent.\n\nBecause if neither of these were true, then you would not be foolish enough to disturb me...",
      "englishSHA256": "deb3c25fefa03ab8f80b2344abf9616fe15d8fecafd3bdb207bfdebeece4acb7"
    },
    {
      "id": "405",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Ah, you are the agent sent by Magistrate Sevren.  Then yes, your business with me is crucial.\n\nI trust Sevren has mustered someone suitable for my task...but we shall see.",
      "englishSHA256": "e349ae8c4102b29a8fd5a677e8b408d3de4352256c3ff04a7fd808b115828cfb"
    },
    {
      "id": "407",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Stay away, foul and unholy creature!  May the Light protect me!  The Scarlet Crusade shall rid Azeroth of your. . .\n\n. . .oh wait.  Is that food for me?  I am so hungry. . .",
      "englishSHA256": "200fc8aac7682653b431bd1e904571b25a0cb34888b2d1d149b4c0bfb4e41646"
    },
    {
      "id": "407",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "By the Light!  Finally some food!  Sweet, sweet pumpkin. . . .",
      "englishSHA256": "157ac3bfbb6aa8f7a5d622da0aba4b57ae641ba64d20d8fbc79547eab33d7d7a"
    },
    {
      "id": "408",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Time is not a luxury we have, <name>.  With each passing hour, the Scourge's hold on Tirisfal Glades grows more firm.",
      "englishSHA256": "e44d8cf067a528262bbcafd4b22b3e478bd2137d04531c9c51564028b44ad8a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "408",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Your actions struck a telling blow against the Scourge.  And your victory will not go unnoticed - not by the Forsaken, nor by our enemies.\n\nContinue the struggle as we all do, <name>, and one day we will drive the Lich King himself from Azeroth!",
      "englishSHA256": "9b3478720aae3a2e96147d98071fd68301129426b311650242d14c296b47120a"
    },
    {
      "id": "409",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "You have defeated Lillith Nefara, proving you are an enemy of the Scourge.  Incredible.\n\nI had believed I was the only <race> with free will, but you have shown me there are others who have broken the Lich King's domination.",
      "englishSHA256": "25a27f996e801b9805240e89d80e4ffb1abf45582c6bca6e1613c7c7e67f4b45"
    },
    {
      "id": "411",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Have you returned Gunther's book?  Has he responded?",
      "englishSHA256": "3cf4c3f95884a65a9935a2d96c726d1fdeb55169a198291c91891f57952ae331"
    },
    {
      "id": "411",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "You convinced him to join us!  You have done a great deed for the Forsaken, <name>.  The Dark Lady will be informed.",
      "englishSHA256": "25bc7e7001a68863711b21d3f211f61b915702f2f19d6a206e0365a77b0b808c"
    },
    {
      "id": "426",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Our battles with the Scourge wage on, <name>.  Do your part and throw those cursed, mindless <race> back into the Plaguelands!",
      "englishSHA256": "05b44f5a53caac706952b02b766bd14be96883357a2e2df6348731ceb8338d4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "426",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Your efforts in the war are felt among us, <name>.  I will not thank you for doing what is necessary, but the Deathguards of Tirisfal will remember your name.",
      "englishSHA256": "24e63822350c25633d03e3c9cb4f9b52bb3d00933f64d15beb1d03d0ac8f5718"
    },
    {
      "id": "427",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Most excellent, <class>.  Your skill in the art of combat is undeniable.",
      "englishSHA256": "bbad66a6794c61f7d83f2539eae9ed14ab7d2a77698b4524b90343c331fd5718"
    },
    {
      "id": "445",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Ah, how good of Apothecary Johaan to send his research.  With so many new developments here in Silverpine, I nearly forgot about the findings coming out of Lordaeron and Tirisfal Glades.  Which reminds me, I need to get those samples off to the Necropolis soon.\n\nBut you must excuse my rambling.  Extend your stay in Silverpine, <name>.  We could use an able bodied <class> like you around here.",
      "englishSHA256": "d33e3af820f228a302352f81f577194999d53317b791e8f3f3d70ca3fbf4dafa"
    },
    {
      "id": "492",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Why if I had my trusted rifle you'd be as good as dead, <class>.  Just wait until the Steam Tank Brigade arrives to rescue me!",
      "englishSHA256": "e06da062e8a04cc84897fe5f683ef7c7f55e275f83ca23a472f366afe62268ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "492",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Ah, a drink at last.  I'm sure it's no Rhapsody Malt but I'll take anything to whet the old whistle at this point.",
      "englishSHA256": "5065c86076b873be25bab2ae4a26318f5ac722c333dd260ef7c2b62981449b2b"
    }
  ],
  "response": {
    "content": [
      {
